(7417155, 1170172, 174999, '<td valign="top">This image has a lot of potential that I see but it was distracting by the telephone lines, I would have given a higher sore if they were cloned out, I like the dramatic sky in the background giving the vibrancy in the trees, but also the yellows seem a bit harsh to me and could be backed up with the yellow lum. and highlights just a tad.</td>', 'This image has a lot of potential that I see but it was distracting by the telephone lines, I would have given a higher sore if they were cloned out, I like the dramatic sky in the background giving the vibrancy in the trees, but also the yellows seem a bit harsh to me and could be backed up with the yellow lum. and highlights just a tad.', '2015-11-18 14:11:34.000000', NULL, 1),
(7417158, 1170238, 174999, '<td valign="top">I love the angle on this and the composition having it in portrait really gave a great feeling of tallness. I love the leaves and the layers with the building on top, just nailed it,  I would have given this a higher score (9 ) but to me it seemed just a bit too dark in the shadows and contrast. but for me this is a 7</td>', 'I love the angle on this and the composition having it in portrait really gave a great feeling of tallness. I love the leaves and the layers with the building on top, just nailed it,  I would have given this a higher score (9 ) but to me it seemed just a bit too dark in the shadows and contrast. but for me this is a 7', '2015-11-18 14:16:57.000000', NULL, 1),
(7417159, 1167913, 174999, '<td valign="top">I expect this in the top 20, I love the natural feel of this image, the warmth and processing really brought this together, the sun, lighting and the composition of the home in the end makes my eyes travel and really wonder what is passed this little creek.<br/> <br/>Well done 9</td>', 'I expect this in the top 20, I love the natural feel of this image, the warmth and processing really brought this together, the sun, lighting and the composition of the home in the end makes my eyes travel and really wonder what is passed this little creek. Well done 9', '2015-11-18 14:17:45.000000', NULL, 1),
(7417160, 1170001, 174999, '<td valign="top">I really love the mist in this photo and the lone kayaker, just very peaceful scene.<br/>I would have given this a higher score, but to me the contrast and shadows seem to clash,  as well as the push for over vibrancy color was added just a tad too much, for me, the feel of the mist was stolen to the beauty feel that this image has.. I really love the composition.</td>', 'I really love the mist in this photo and the lone kayaker, just very peaceful scene.I would have given this a higher score, but to me the contrast and shadows seem to clash,  as well as the push for over vibrancy color was added just a tad too much, for me, the feel of the mist was stolen to the beauty feel that this image has.. I really love the composition.', '2015-11-18 14:23:02.000000', NULL, 1),
(7417161, 1168173, 174999, '<td valign="top">I really love aspen trees just such beauty in the fall when they change, the details on these are really, really nice and The colors lighting and tone just bring out the beauty that these trees really have.<br/> I expect this in the top 20</td>', 'I really love aspen trees just such beauty in the fall when they change, the details on these are really, really nice and The colors lighting and tone just bring out the beauty that these trees really have. I expect this in the top 20', '2015-11-18 14:23:57.000000', NULL, 1),
