(7417219, 1170045, 174999, '<td valign="top">this makes me dizzy, I gave this an 8  because of the colors of the yellows and greens just bring it together and the colors are not too over saturated or overcooked..  For some odd reason, and I think it is because of the yellow tree just being in the right spot of composition. For me, it is a fun whimsical shot</td>', 'this makes me dizzy, I gave this an 8  because of the colors of the yellows and greens just bring it together and the colors are not too over saturated or overcooked..  For some odd reason, and I think it is because of the yellow tree just being in the right spot of composition. For me, it is a fun whimsical shot', '2015-11-18 20:16:24.000000', NULL, 1),
(7417220, 1169522, 174999, '<td valign="top">I gave this an 8 I would have given it a 9 or 10 but did not care about the darkness that is on the bottom or the sides that surrounds this beautiful image.. I think the tones and shades are just beautiful, love the composition, the lighting on the path, but underneath her feet and behind  her, for me, it just took that feel away that I had for the rest of it. Not too over cooked for the colors,  the reds bring the yellows together as complimentary colors which pulls this image together.<br/> The darkness just threw me off a bit, I am Curious about the post processing for this image and wonder if this was a natural shading that this had or if this was done on purpose, I would like to know more about it.</td>', 'I gave this an 8 I would have given it a 9 or 10 but did not care about the darkness that is on the bottom or the sides that surrounds this beautiful image.. I think the tones and shades are just beautiful, love the composition, the lighting on the path, but underneath her feet and behind  her, for me, it just took that feel away that I had for the rest of it. Not too over cooked for the colors,  the reds bring the yellows together as complimentary colors which pulls this image together. The darkness just threw me off a bit, I am Curious about the post processing for this image and wonder if this was a natural shading that this had or if this was done on purpose, I would like to know more about it.', '2015-11-18 20:20:50.000000', NULL, 1),
