(7417824, 1169164, 174999, '<td valign="top">This really brought attention to my eyes, natural sand &amp; the path where it lead, the colors are great. it met the challenge and I think I would have bumped it higher but there is a weird dark shadow spot behind the pine tree on the left on top of the hill which distracted me from this beautiful image _6 already voted</td>', 'This really brought attention to my eyes, natural sand & the path where it lead, the colors are great. it met the challenge and I think I would have bumped it higher but there is a weird dark shadow spot behind the pine tree on the left on top of the hill which distracted me from this beautiful image _6 already voted', '2015-11-22 13:59:56.000000', NULL, 1),
(7417825, 1167771, 174999, '<td valign="top">I am kinda lost in this image. My eyes want to dart and I have no where really to focus my attention on, it wants to be lead to the wonderful building on the left I think that has an interesting look to it, I would love to see more of it, as for the fall look it met the challenge but nothing more to bump it higher, 5 already voted</td>', 'I am kinda lost in this image. My eyes want to dart and I have no where really to focus my attention on, it wants to be lead to the wonderful building on the left I think that has an interesting look to it, I would love to see more of it, as for the fall look it met the challenge but nothing more to bump it higher, 5 already voted', '2015-11-22 14:01:21.000000', NULL, 1),
(7417826, 1170217, 174999, '<td valign="top">love the title and the warmth this image brings, for my eyes it was way to bright to even look at the photo in more detail because it was almost blinding to me, it was  look into the sun, maybe I feel I am like a vampire or something LOL .. less highlights, brights/whites?? voted before 5</td>', 'love the title and the warmth this image brings, for my eyes it was way to bright to even look at the photo in more detail because it was almost blinding to me, it was  look into the sun, maybe I feel I am like a vampire or something LOL .. less highlights, brights/whites?? voted before 5', '2015-11-22 14:03:28.000000', NULL, 1),
