(7417831, 1169204, 174999, '<td valign="top">love this concept and really like the heart in the middle,  for me the reason I scored lower was that there is a huge spot which gives a glaring blare spot light  in the middle under the leaf which distracted me from the main image of the leaf with the hole, (i think its a car perhaps and the shine from the windsheild) I think if it wasn''t for the car there I would have scored it higher<br/> <br/>had already voted</td>', 'love this concept and really like the heart in the middle,  for me the reason I scored lower was that there is a huge spot which gives a glaring blare spot light  in the middle under the leaf which distracted me from the main image of the leaf with the hole, (i think its a car perhaps and the shine from the windsheild) I think if it wasn''t for the car there I would have scored it higher had already voted', '2015-11-22 14:10:22.000000', NULL, 1),
