(7417839, 1170181, 174999, '<td valign="top">alot of leaves on the ground shots, but this one I actually bumped up your score to a 6..<br/> <br/>The color of the fall and yet there is one leaf that is still being stubborn, the strength and details of the leaves gives it a nice challenge to my eyes which makes for good composition and color contrast. My eyes like it~!</td>', 'alot of leaves on the ground shots, but this one I actually bumped up your score to a 6.. The color of the fall and yet there is one leaf that is still being stubborn, the strength and details of the leaves gives it a nice challenge to my eyes which makes for good composition and color contrast. My eyes like it~!', '2015-11-22 14:17:41.000000', NULL, 1),
(7417840, 1170162, 174999, '<td valign="top">This photo seems sooo relaxing and pleasing to visit, to actually see ppl fly fishing just brings this composition together. a potiential winner for  For me, however it seemed the aperture was too low for for this particular scene... the DOF is too shallow as well as the colors being just a bit too bright with the highlights and over saturated. The contrast and shadows of the rocks and water  seem a bit too dark as well as it the horizon being tilted and not straight. Lots of potential though!!<br/> <br/>Already voted</td>', 'This photo seems sooo relaxing and pleasing to visit, to actually see ppl fly fishing just brings this composition together. a potiential winner for  For me, however it seemed the aperture was too low for for this particular scene... the DOF is too shallow as well as the colors being just a bit too bright with the highlights and over saturated. The contrast and shadows of the rocks and water  seem a bit too dark as well as it the horizon being tilted and not straight. Lots of potential though!! Already voted', '2015-11-22 14:21:51.000000', NULL, 1),
