(7418218, 1170156, 180118, '<td valign="top">Thanks for the comments... I originally was going for a multiple exposure looking for a potential HDR, but decided to keep this single exposure. I increased the exposure from -2 to "0" and this is what I got w a little cloning on the tree trunk chromatic aberration. It was a fun shoot. Thanks for the votes and inspiration to compete in the future.</td>', 'Thanks for the comments... I originally was going for a multiple exposure looking for a potential HDR, but decided to keep this single exposure. I increased the exposure from -2 to "0" and this is what I got w a little cloning on the tree trunk chromatic aberration. It was a fun shoot. Thanks for the votes and inspiration to compete in the future.', '2015-11-24 00:16:49.000000', NULL, 0),
(7418222, 1170247, 98565, '<td valign="top">while your outtake is a nice picture it''s just nice. I like this far more and it deserves more than a 4 or 5 imho, it stands out from the crowd with autumnal atmosphere<br/>Maybe voters missed the vibrant orange colours ...? And I (gave a 6) would have rated it higher if you cropped off a little of the light upper part where nothing happens</td>', 'while your outtake is a nice picture it''s just nice. I like this far more and it deserves more than a 4 or 5 imho, it stands out from the crowd with autumnal atmosphereMaybe voters missed the vibrant orange colours ...? And I (gave a 6) would have rated it higher if you cropped off a little of the light upper part where nothing happens', '2015-11-24 01:52:51.000000', NULL, 0),
